  <item>
    <title>王家卫给的方子，“沪上厨神”的手艺，教你在上海“吃春天”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f60bf60decaeb094e1ceff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f60bf60decaeb094e1ceff</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本周我们邀请来本帮菜名厨徐铭恩，聊聊江南人家吃春菜那些事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>恰逢博客录制几天前，导演王家卫神秘造访了徐大厨的工作室，两人整晚边聊边做边吃，炮制出几道做法上创新，风味却深度复古上海老底子的菜肴。导演天马行空的想象力和对食材的洞察力给与了大厨不少新的灵感，大厨也将在这期节目里独家分享王家卫独特的食物美学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>干货预警：本期节目大量内容是对料理方法的详细展开，不会做菜的听众可能会觉得有点儿干巴，对喜欢在家做菜的听众会特别友好。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>shownotes附上大厨与王家卫碰撞出的一些成果，和播客中大厨谈及的部分春菜食材：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>王家卫版马兰头猪肝：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkkiwfRHE2cIadQ9NHEBxJR-4FI7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>王家卫版葱香酥炸川乌：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiLArMGlAjMxEtt3DeogbXJuipM2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>刚出海的川乌：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh6E12wDdvtC_By1BVlORvOZZKDg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>崇明本地芦笋嫩尖 颜色碧绿 菜味浓郁：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8GWE2wBaHA1TdynGlPsnKMclPR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>大厨平时凌晨5点会去的青浦菜场，菜场背后的小码头连着淀山湖：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuwXbY1zxc_PhLEbmrM1bUUsKRlu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>上海郊野菜场里的练塘茭白：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln735tO-Wx8O2alXQv3Jov-XMKde.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：徐铭恩</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：董天晔</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：秦东颖</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 海鲜也是春菜，第一波得吃海蜇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> 海蜇之后就是小黄鱼 但浙江渔民口中的小金条大有来头 价格也不一般</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> 从渔民那里偷师 顶级的小黄鱼的特别做法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 春季的带鱼肥美 尤其是舟山的“油带”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 崇明的芦笋 大厨上桌的春天第一道“芽菜”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 马兰头 菊花脑 枸杞头 草头 豆苗……带来最浓郁的春天气息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 王家卫推荐的香椿头独特吃法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1871">31:11</a> 王家卫传授的马兰头料理秘籍：爆炒猪肝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2214">36:54</a> 王家卫亲授料理秘籍之三：酥炸川乌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 王家卫亲授料理秘籍之四：春季宽韭蛋炒饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 大厨的腌笃鲜，如何用食材的融合激发春天的新鲜味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3830">63:50</a> 大厨的心头好 春天去千岛湖吃胖头鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4242">70:42</a> 春季的高邮湖美品：白水鱼&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4358">72:38</a> 进入初夏 等待鲜美的练塘茭白上市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4471">74:31</a> 茭白地里的特别美食：甲鱼&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4733">78:53</a> 春季过后的新一轮美食：笔杆黄鳝&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4943">82:23</a> 大厨讲刀鱼 本帮菜传统里的独特料理方法&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5212">86:52</a> 大厨的买菜心法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5629">93:49</a> 研发、传承、创新还是扩张店面？名厨面对的抉择&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5891">98:11</a> 台州菜、宁波菜与本帮菜&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6146">102:26</a> 大厨自己在家烧什么 出去又会吃什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容请联系：请关注微信公众号“申藏bleu”并在后台留言，分享您的看法，输送有趣的选题。</span></p>]]></description>
